<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif">Dear&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">[Insert Name</span>]</span><span style="font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 12pt;">,</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif">Thank you for your
interest in partnering with the American Red Cross. We hope you will find that our
programs for schools offer a meaningful and rewarding way for your students to
engage with the Red Cross and give back to their community. By partnering with
us, your students can make the difference young people often strive to make.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif"><br></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif">Hope begins with you.</span></b><span style="font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif"> It begins with your school’s decision to support
the Red Cross and patients in need. It begins with a student’s decision to
support blood donation in your school or in the community. Thank you for your
interest in helping save lives.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif">I will call you in
a few days and look forward to speaking with you. Your impact in the community
and within your school can be powerful, visible and most importantly, lifesaving.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:
Arial"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif;mso-bidi-font-family:
Arial">Sincerely, <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="ui-provider fy b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak" dir="ltr" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[Insert Name]</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
